                                                "sense_id": "a3d80a51-af1e-3a0d-86da-929652d9e6ab",
                                                "text": "\"If you're accused of profiling or pretextual stops, you can bring your daily logbook to court and document that pulling over motorists for 'stickler' reasons is part of your customary pattern,\" Remsberg writes, \"not a glaring exception conveniently dusted off in the defendant's case.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0bde23b0-550f-4b05-9bc0-66744c903227",
                                                "sense_id": "a3d80a51-af1e-3a0d-86da-929652d9e6ab",
                                                "text": "As Trevor Corson, author of “The Story of Sushi” explains, in Japan, sushi is typically eaten at a bar, where it’s customary for the customer to chat with the chef, who can recommend what’s in season. The short window during which the fish is fresh also makes it more likely to be tastier in Japan."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cc2bf91c-a680-3fc5-b141-66a602b93394",
                                        "entry_id": "696aa5cd-d648-38f8-853b-f6b572377ca3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Holding or held by custom."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b914eb17-3f61-490e-85c8-f40b014822dd",
                                                "sense_id": "cc2bf91c-a680-3fc5-b141-66a602b93394",
                                                "text": "customary tenants"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3597c7e2-55d5-42f2-b7b6-099e4ce907ca",
                                                "sense_id": "cc2bf91c-a680-3fc5-b141-66a602b93394",
                                                "text": "The tenants are chiefly customary and heriotable."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
